1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:58,770
Why do you look different from before ?

25
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:01,280
Ma Liang was a possessed body.

26
00:02:01,080 --> 00:02:03,100
Of course, I look different.

27
00:02:03,290 --> 00:02:05,050
What you see in front of you

28
00:02:04,860 --> 00:02:06,680
is my real appearance.

29
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:09,690
Senior,

30
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:12,450
you said you wanted a pill to breakthrough ?

31
00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:13,450
Yes.

32
00:02:13,880 --> 00:02:16,540
I have a special cultivation method.

33
00:02:16,380 --> 00:02:18,610
I have to rely on this body to breakthrough.

34
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:23,450
Although you will need many pills to reach Core Formation,

35
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:24,690
I can make them.

36
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:27,690
But reaching Nascent Soul

37
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:29,760
requires much more spiritual energy...

38
00:02:29,620 --> 00:02:31,850
If you take so many pills within such a short time,

39
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:34,090
Senior will poison himself !

40
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:36,780
Don't worry,

41
00:02:36,760 --> 00:02:39,050
I use an ancient technique

42
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:41,380
that allows me to take as many pills as needed.

43
00:02:42,880 --> 00:02:45,700
Then I'll help you breakthrough to Core Formation first.

44
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:47,650
These pills should be enough.

45
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:51,150
Here are items I gathered over the years.

46
00:02:50,970 --> 00:02:53,330
See if you can find something valuable here.

47
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:06,650
Senior,

48
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:09,690
where did you get this thing ?

49
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:11,090
This ?

50
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:12,850
Is it a treasure ?

51
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:15,130
If we can open this furnace

52
00:03:15,110 --> 00:03:16,810
you will be able to breakthrough.

53
00:03:17,640 --> 00:03:18,610
Really ?

54
00:03:19,480 --> 00:03:21,870
This talisman is called a pill seal.

55
00:03:21,670 --> 00:03:23,850
It feeds a pill with spiritual energy.

56
00:03:23,630 --> 00:03:25,330
According to the records,

57
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:26,720
it was used on at least grade 6 pills.

58
00:03:26,510 --> 00:03:27,570
Grade 6 ?

59
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:30,630
No matter what the effect of this pill is,

60
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:33,530
it will have enough energy to form a Nascent Soul.

61
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:35,800
But...

62
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:39,770
the method to open a pill seal has been lost to time.

63
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:41,540
If we open it forcefully,

64
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:43,730
the quality of the pill will drop.

65
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:45,900
It may even

66
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,810
turn the pill to ashes.

67
00:03:51,320 --> 00:03:54,330
This jade belonged to the person who owned it.

68
00:03:54,610 --> 00:03:57,240
See if you can find a way to break the seal.

69
00:03:59,170 --> 00:04:00,610
In this jade,

70
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:02,280
there are just pill recipes.

71
00:04:02,200 --> 00:04:04,220
There isn't such a method...

72
00:04:06,370 --> 00:04:07,610
It's fine.

73
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:09,300
Senior, focus on reaching Core Formation.

74
00:04:09,450 --> 00:04:11,130
As for opening the pill seal,

75
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:12,370
leave it to Wan'er.

76
00:04:17,500 --> 00:04:18,490
Senior,

77
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:21,050
this is a grade 2 Yellow Spring Pill,

78
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:22,690
it will expand your meridians

79
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:24,160
so you should take it first.

80
00:04:24,380 --> 00:04:26,530
But it's very toxic

81
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:27,850
so you have to be careful.

82
00:04:39,630 --> 00:04:41,730
This is a Three Purification Pill,

83
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:45,410
it will cleanse your meridians, easing the flow of spiritual energy.

84
00:04:48,700 --> 00:04:50,730
This is a Mystic Ice Pill,

85
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:53,150
it will help you with your cold-type cultivation.

86
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,880
This is the Thousand Chances Pill,

87
00:04:55,660 --> 00:04:57,730
it can absorb the essence of the world.

88
00:04:58,800 --> 00:04:59,920
The Barrier Breaking Pill

89
00:04:59,690 --> 00:05:01,550
will dissipate the barriers

90
00:05:01,310 --> 00:05:03,480
formed in your body by pills.

91
00:05:07,900 --> 00:05:09,150
This is the Primordial Unity Pill,

92
00:05:08,970 --> 00:05:10,150
it's a tonic.

93
00:05:11,760 --> 00:05:14,570
How can you swallow a Primordial Unity Pill like a candy !?

94
00:05:14,520 --> 00:05:17,660
I worked hard to get one when I was alive...

95
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:21,860
This one is also a treasure !

96
00:05:21,690 --> 00:05:23,410
You're wasting them...

97
00:05:23,280 --> 00:05:24,750
You're just forming your Core,

98
00:05:24,550 --> 00:05:27,910
you should be ashamed !

99
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:30,610
One more step, I will combine the three Cold Cores.

100
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:32,750
and reach Core Formation.

101
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:38,450
A Heaven Separating Pill ?

102
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,410
Senior !

103
00:05:41,140 --> 00:05:42,190
Senior...

104
00:05:42,770 --> 00:05:45,370
This is a Heaven Separating Pill made from Demon Blood Vine.

105
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:47,770
Its effect isn't... as good.

106
00:05:47,520 --> 00:05:48,250
But !

107
00:06:13,590 --> 00:06:14,850
It seems

108
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:17,810
the pill seal needs a lot of energy to be opened.

109
00:06:30,900 --> 00:06:32,330
Mystic Wild Grass,

110
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:33,490
cold type.

111
00:06:33,900 --> 00:06:36,770
It has the effect of absorbing spiritual energy.

112
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:38,890
This may be it !

113
00:06:38,880 --> 00:06:41,050
I just need a few excipients

114
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:43,850
and I can try to break open the pill seal.

115
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:11,130
What have you two found out in the month of spying on her ?

116
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:16,210
Elder Li's research was all over the place.

117
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:19,450
From pill recipes to meditation effects.

118
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:21,790
According to our observations,

119
00:07:21,590 --> 00:07:24,010
there wasn't anything that stood out.

120
00:07:25,580 --> 00:07:27,370
Did she record anything ?

121
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:29,650
Yes,

122
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:32,570
but it's equally as random.

123
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:34,970
It's as if she didn't have a goal.

124
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:37,330
Young Master,

125
00:07:37,900 --> 00:07:39,930
as a top 3 alchemist of the Cloud Sky Sect,

126
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:42,090
Elder Li is very clever and cautious.

127
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:45,040
She hid her search among other things.

128
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,650
If that's the truth,

129
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:48,410
then she has succeeded.

130
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:50,730
Incompetent fools !

131
00:07:58,580 --> 00:08:00,840
What's the point of being angry at them ?

132
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:01,970
Look at you,

133
00:08:02,120 --> 00:08:04,330
you don't look like an elder.

134
00:08:05,080 --> 00:08:06,560
I'm sorry, we're leaving.

135
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:09,450
Father,

136
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:11,610
your son almost died !

137
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:13,250
That ghost

138
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:15,330
appeared in front of me !

139
00:08:15,730 --> 00:08:17,930
If I didn't have that spirit bell,

140
00:08:17,680 --> 00:08:20,170
I'd be no more than a piece of flesh !

141
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:22,490
In the past few days,

142
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:25,120
only that bitch's friend entered the Cloud Sky Sect.

143
00:08:24,930 --> 00:08:26,680
It must have something to do with her.

144
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:28,950
I want them dead !

145
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:33,930
Don't worry,

146
00:08:33,860 --> 00:08:36,810
if that coward kid dares to show up again,

147
00:08:36,560 --> 00:08:39,030
I will definitely make him pay for it.

148
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:43,400
You just need to prepare for the wedding.

149
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:04,210
I don't have enough spiritual energy.

150
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:06,810
I have to go back to the Library

151
00:09:06,790 --> 00:09:09,530
to find a way to increase it.

152
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:24,050
Get out.

153
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,650
Don't bother my cultivation.

154
00:09:27,650 --> 00:09:29,690
We are about to get married.

155
00:09:29,680 --> 00:09:32,270
Why are you so cold ?

156
00:09:35,010 --> 00:09:36,490
I forgot to ask you earlier.

157
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:38,890
What's your relationship

158
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:40,730
with that man ?

159
00:09:41,100 --> 00:09:44,410
Does this also need to be reported to Elder Sun ?

160
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,010
Wan'er,

161
00:09:53,340 --> 00:09:55,370
the sect made a lot of preparations.

162
00:09:55,210 --> 00:09:56,290
Look,

163
00:09:56,040 --> 00:09:58,130
they sent a gift in advance.

164
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:00,010
Do you like it ?

165
00:10:03,740 --> 00:10:05,780
You can think that I don't care

166
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:07,730
but you are very important to me.

167
00:10:07,760 --> 00:10:10,650
I won't let you run away.

168
00:10:11,110 --> 00:10:12,890
This marriage

169
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:15,170
will go through

170
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:17,870
even if you don't want to.

171
00:10:21,830 --> 00:10:23,800
The Sect Leader has ordered that

172
00:10:23,640 --> 00:10:26,010
Elder Li cannot leave the Southern Courtyard.

173
00:10:26,430 --> 00:10:28,130
She will prepare

174
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:29,850
for the Dual Cultivation ceremony.

175
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:32,090
Without a direct order from the Cloud Sky Sect,

176
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:33,170
she cannot leave.

177
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:34,370
Understood !

178
00:11:30,860 --> 00:11:34,370
Wang Lin's avatar
Early stage Core Formation

179
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:39,090
Oh my god.

180
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:40,440
In just a month,

181
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:43,490
Master already reached Core Formation !

182
00:11:44,060 --> 00:11:46,210
Disc...iple...

183
00:11:49,500 --> 00:11:50,730
You...

184
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:52,780
really reached Core Formation ?

185
00:11:53,060 --> 00:11:54,530
As expected

186
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:56,780
of Teacher's old friend.

187
00:11:56,920 --> 00:12:00,130
Should I... call you Uncle ?

188
00:12:00,260 --> 00:12:02,340
You kindly taught me alchemy.

189
00:12:02,390 --> 00:12:04,210
You don't have to be so polite.

190
00:12:06,490 --> 00:12:09,290
Is something going on with Wan'er ?

191
00:12:10,870 --> 00:12:12,810
Teacher was grounded by Sun Zhenwei.

192
00:12:12,560 --> 00:12:14,050
She cannot leave

193
00:12:13,800 --> 00:12:15,330
the Southern Courtyard.

194
00:12:15,920 --> 00:12:17,490
I'm afraid this will go on

195
00:12:17,290 --> 00:12:18,890
until the ceremony is over.

196
00:12:20,960 --> 00:12:23,290
She asked me to give you this jade.

197
00:12:24,760 --> 00:12:25,690
Senior,

198
00:12:25,930 --> 00:12:27,570
Wan'er's is fine.

199
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:28,730
Don't worry.

200
00:12:29,280 --> 00:12:32,290
The pill seal needs a lot of spiritual energy

201
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:34,610
to be opened safely.

202
00:12:35,060 --> 00:12:37,730
Wan'er is trapped in the Southern Courtyard,

203
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:40,410
unable to find the required herbs.

204
00:12:40,900 --> 00:12:41,890
Now,

205
00:12:41,920 --> 00:12:43,850
I can only think of only one way.

206
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:46,890
There is a talisman at the top floor of the Library.

207
00:12:46,700 --> 00:12:48,320
If you can get it,

208
00:12:48,080 --> 00:12:50,370
we will borrow the power

209
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:52,250
of the Heaven Stealing Furnace

210
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:53,450
to open the pill seal.

211
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:57,330
The top floor of the Library is very strange.

212
00:12:57,330 --> 00:13:00,040
I heard that when it was being built,

213
00:13:00,260 --> 00:13:02,090
the sect spent a lot of money

214
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:05,170
to hire a cultivator from a rank 4 country.

215
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:07,970
He came to polish the white jade pillars.

216
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:10,040
It was only completed a few months ago.

217
00:13:09,840 --> 00:13:11,290
Moreover,

218
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:13,820
a Nascent Soul Elder guards it nonstop.

219
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:15,610
If you want to take that talisman,

220
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:16,930
it won't be easy.

221
00:13:48,910 --> 00:13:50,730
This jade pillar

222
00:13:50,560 --> 00:13:53,050
has defensive restrictions on it.

223
00:14:21,800 --> 00:14:25,670
Lu Fei
Outer Cloud Sky Sect Elder
Early stage Nascent Soul

224
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:24,490
You dare enter the Library of the Cloud Sky Sect ?

225
00:14:24,280 --> 00:14:26,530
You deserve to be executed.

226
00:14:27,570 --> 00:14:30,330
Even with restrictions, there is still a guard.

227
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:31,810
This means that

228
00:14:31,620 --> 00:14:33,410
the restriction only snares

229
00:14:33,170 --> 00:14:34,890
while the cultivator attacks.

230
00:14:36,510 --> 00:14:38,440
I can't beat a Nascent Soul myself.

231
00:14:38,270 --> 00:14:39,930
But with these restrictions in my hands

232
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:41,480
an Early stage Nascent Soul

233
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:43,380
cannot defeat me either.

234
00:14:54,870 --> 00:14:57,090
How can he control the restrictions !?

235
00:14:57,190 --> 00:14:59,170
This guy must be caught !

236
00:15:09,820 --> 00:15:11,770
You overestimate yourself !

237
00:15:16,200 --> 00:15:18,170
No matter how powerful you are,

238
00:15:18,150 --> 00:15:20,150
you're still just a Core Formation brat.

239
00:15:30,520 --> 00:15:31,940
What kind of spell is this ?

240
00:15:32,060 --> 00:15:33,240
You brat !

241
00:15:33,340 --> 00:15:35,610
Just you wait !

242
00:15:36,230 --> 00:15:38,210
With my Core Formation cultivation

243
00:15:38,170 --> 00:15:40,290
I can only bind him.

244
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:42,890
When I use the flag at Nascent Soul

245
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:45,090
I wonder how strong it will be.

246
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:07,100
Did you hear ?

247
00:16:06,880 --> 00:16:07,970
That thief

248
00:16:07,760 --> 00:16:09,300
not only stole a talisman

249
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:11,570
but then he completely vanished.

250
00:16:11,680 --> 00:16:13,890
The Nascent Soul Elders are worried.

251
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:16,060
Everyone in the sect is being interrogated.

252
00:16:16,240 --> 00:16:18,090
The Nascent Soul Elders

253
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:20,210
investigated using their Divine Sense.

254
00:16:20,280 --> 00:16:23,210
Master is only at Core Formation

255
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:25,570
but his Divine Sense is stronger than theirs.

256
00:16:26,760 --> 00:16:28,170
Even after probing him

257
00:16:27,920 --> 00:16:30,330
they couldn't find anything.

258
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:36,730
3 days later

259
00:16:36,040 --> 00:16:39,570
Ouyang Zi
Master Alchemist of the Cloud Sky Sect
Early stage Nascent Soul

260
00:16:36,690 --> 00:16:39,450
The hour of Yin has come.

261
00:16:39,840 --> 00:16:41,330
Everyone,

262
00:16:41,440 --> 00:16:43,610
open the furnace.

263
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:22,290
I've had my share of wounds,

264
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:22,290
now I want to fight back.

265
00:17:22,120 --> 00:17:25,850
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

266
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:31,770
that's blocking all my hopes

267
00:17:28,560 --> 00:17:31,770
for life ?

268
00:17:33,320 --> 00:17:37,530
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

269
00:17:35,040 --> 00:17:37,530
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

270
00:17:37,600 --> 00:17:40,930
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

271
00:17:41,040 --> 00:17:46,930
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

272
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:46,930
out of reach.

273
00:17:48,040 --> 00:17:52,410
Immortals

274
00:17:49,080 --> 00:17:52,410
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

275
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:56,450
Renegades

276
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:56,450
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

277
00:17:56,200 --> 00:18:00,290
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

278
00:17:58,150 --> 00:18:00,290
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

279
00:18:00,280 --> 00:18:04,410
because I don't see the harm in that.

280
00:18:06,160 --> 00:18:12,210
My new body opens its eyes

281
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:12,210
and awakens from its dream.

282
00:18:12,080 --> 00:18:19,770
I have overcome many trials

283
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:19,770
to get this body back.

284
00:18:19,720 --> 00:18:27,410
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

285
00:18:23,760 --> 00:18:27,410
I can still see.

286
00:18:27,560 --> 00:18:36,770
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

287
00:18:31,520 --> 00:18:36,770
by my own hands.

288
00:18:51,960 --> 00:18:58,170
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

289
00:18:54,680 --> 00:18:58,170
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

290
00:18:57,920 --> 00:19:05,730
With a flick of a finger,

291
00:18:59,360 --> 00:19:05,730
only my indomitable heart remains.

292
00:19:05,520 --> 00:19:15,130
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

293
00:19:11,480 --> 00:19:15,130
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

294
00:19:15,120 --> 00:19:22,970
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

295
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:22,970
like the descent of a god.
